<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Akakolochahe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa jha Pauli kwa Akakolochahe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Akakolochahe</para>
  <para style="toc3">Akak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa jha Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akakolochahe</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa jha Ntenga Pauli kwa Akakolochahe kikajhandikwe na Pauli mu chula jha 1:1. Akajhandike baluwa jhenje pakibha mukipungo pange pakibha ku muche gwa ku Loma muchaka cha makome chita pabhelwika njwe Yecho Kilichitu. Baluwa jhenje kwa Akakolochahe na baluwa jhela kwa Akaepecho na baluwa kwa Akafilemone ikemwa baluwa ya ku kipungo nhwalo Pauli akajhandike pakibha kwenio. Akajhandike baluwa kwa likunde lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu lilibhii ku muche gwa Kolochahe. Pauli akatumbulichejhe likunde lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu ku Kolochahe ngita chaichimulila mu chula jha 2:1, nambo apalitwa kulitangatila likunde lende lilinnyeketii Kilichitu. Pange iwechekana Epafula ndi jwatumbulicha lilongo lende lya bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu nhwalo ahumila ku muche gwa ku Kolochahe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pauli akachitwichwe na mabholo ghuwange nkate jha lilongo lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu lya kwenio ku Kolochahe, chehemo jhenje ndi ikatoi pwache ngolonga kuchimulila nhwalo gwenio. Iwechekana pange pakibha na lilongo lya Akakilichitu lihembukilo lyabhe likibha kwa Akayahude bhubhajhighita kwachokolekeya Akakilichitu bhange bhankengame malaghilo ghabhe gha Kiyahude ghighaumila mu Lilaghano lya Makacho, na achwa kujhingii jando. Pauli akajhandike hotu kubhehe Akakilichitu bhipalwajhe kilebhe chochoha, nambo nga Kilichitu ndo, mu chula jha 1:15-20, na mabholo ghighahumita kwa bhando ghakwetejhe mana, mu chula jha 2:8.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli atumbuu kulijhambucha lilongo lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu lya ku Kolochahe, mu chula jha 1:1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Peniya Pauli ijhandika ukolo gwa Kilichitu, na ndi pajhangwila kwa nhwalo gwa mabholo ghuwange ghighajhenii ku Kolochahe, mu chula jha 1:3-3:4.</para>
  <para style="io">Ngita chayobalile mu baluwa yake yamahele, Pauli itumii nucho jhenge jha baluwa kwalaghalalikiya Akakilichitu chibhipalwa kutama, mu chula jha 3:5-4:6.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli ijhomolela kwa kwajhambucha kabhele na kwalaghalikii bhando kubhehe baluwa jhenje ichomwa palonge jhabhe kwa lilongo lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu na kwa bhando bhange, mu chula jha 4:7-18.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="s">Baluwa jha Pauli kwa Akakolochahe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Nenga Napauli, natenga jwa Yecho Kilichitu kwa kupala Chapanga, pamonga na Timocheyo nnongo gwito.<verse eid="COL 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Punnyandikila mangota mabhando bha Chapanga bhumitama ku Kolochahe, makolongo bhito bhumuhobholeka kwa kulombana na Kilichitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Tunnyopela umbone na uteeke kuhumii kwa Chapanga Tate gwito.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli inyopa Chapanga na kunchengula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Machiko ghoha putunnyopela tunchenguu Chapanga, Tate gwa Bhambo gwito Yecho Kilichitu, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />nhwalo tujhohine chimunhobholela Bhambo Yecho Kilichitu, na chimwapala bhando bhoha bha Chapanga. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Nhwalo gwa kihobholelo chino na upalo gwino lihobholelo lela limekwii kunane kwa Chapanga, ndi lela linyohina kuhumii makacho kwa lilobhe lya chakaka lya Lilobhe lya Mbone. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Lilobhe lya Mbone lyenio linhikilii mangota na kujhenela pannema ghoha na kuleta ghambone, ngita chiliteila kwino mangota kuhumii lichiko lela punyohina umbone gwa Chapanga na kumanya uteeke chiubhile. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Mukibholite umbone gwa Chapanga kuhumii kwa Epafula, nhenga lihengo nnyito jhutumpahii, ntumiche jwahobholeka jwa Kilichitu kunhwalo ghito. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Jwenio ndi jwatuchimulila malobhe gha upalo gwino ghupekiwe na Uhuke gwa Chapanga.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Kunhwalo gwenio kubhoke putujhohina malobhe ghino, tujhendelela kunyopela. Tunnyopa Chapanga ampelengane kumanya ghoha ghaghapala kwa malango ghoha na kumanya kutupatite na Uhuke gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Tujhopa yenio kupala nhoto kutama ngita chapala Bhambo, na nnyendelela kuhenga ghighanhalalicha jwenio. Na nnyendelela kuhenga ghughabhii ghambone na nchocha kukola mukumanya Chapanga. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Chapanga ampela makakala kwa uhotolo gwake mu ng'alicho nkolongwa nhoto kuhimbilila ghoha changatotokela. <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />Na kwa luheko muchengula Tate jwantehi mme chehemo jha mambu ghabhabhekii akanyahinyahi bhake mu unahota nkolongwa gwa lumule. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Jwenie ndi jwatughombwila kubhoke mu makakala gha lubhendo, na kutujhingiya munahota nkolongwa gwa Mwana mundo jwampala, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />kupete kwa jwenio tughombokoka na kulekekewa uhakaho gwito.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilichitu na lihengo lyake</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kilichitu jhumumwene alandine njwe na Chapanga jwangabhonekana. Jwenio akibha kabula jha ihumbi yoha kupanganwa.<verse eid="COL 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Nhwalo kupete jwenie, Chapanga akapangine ilebhe yoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:16">ibhii kunane kwa Chapanga na ibhii pannema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:16">ibhonekana na yangabhoneka, ibhehe ihumbi ya kihuke ibhii na makakala na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:16">akanahota na bhibhalongocha na bhubhabhii na ukindendeke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="COL 1:16">Yoha ikapanginwe kupete jwenio na kwa nhwalo gwake.<verse eid="COL 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Kilichitu akibha kabula jha ilebhe yoha, ilebhe yoha ikamulana nde pamonga kwa jwenio.<verse eid="COL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Jwenio ndi muto gwa yegha, yegha jhene ndi lilongo lya bhando bhibhanyeketii jwenio. Kilichitu ndi lihembuko lya ughome gwa yegha jhene. Jwenio ndi jwayokichwa abhehe jwakutumbula kwa ilebhe yoha.<verse eid="COL 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Nhwalo Chapanga jwenio akahalalichwe ukamilicho gwake ghoha ubhehe nkate jha Kilichitu.<verse eid="COL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Kupete Mwana mundo, ilebhe yoha ijhelanichwe na Chapanga jwenio, na kwa miyahe jhake jhijhitike pa nchalaba aleta uteeke na ilebhe yoha ibhii pannema na ibhii kunane kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Peniya makacho mangota mukibha kutale na Chapanga na helahela mukibha akamakoko bhake nhwalo gwa malango ghino ghanganandela na matendwa ghino ghanganandela. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Nambo ngohe, Chapanga antei mangota akakoche mundo kupetele kuwe kwa yegha jha Mwana mundo, ndi ampeleke palonge jhake kongo mmii nyahinyahi na bhamaha changalemwa. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Nambo chimupalwa, nnyendelela kukikamulii kihobholelo chino kone nchengwitwe mu chinge nganganga, hilu nkotoka kujheketela kunyuanyua kubhoke mu lihobholelo lela lipilwe pala punyohina Lilobhe lya Mbone. Ne Pauli ndeilwe natumiche jwa Lilobhe lya Mbone ndi lilitangichwe kwa bhando bhoha bha pannema.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengo lya Pauli kwa lilongo lya bhando lilinnyeketii Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Ngohe nihanganila kung'ahika kwa nhwalo gwino mangota, mitweleya jhegha jhango kwa ghala ghighapongwii mumang'ahiko gha Kilichitu kwa nhwalo jha yegha jhake ndi lilongo lya bhando bhubhanyeketii Kilichitu. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Na nenga mekwite na Chapanga mme natumiche jwa lilongo lya bhando bhubhanyeketii Kilichitu. Ambii lihengo lya kutangacha Lilobhe lya umbone gwake gwamaha, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />lijhambu lyenio ndi chile jhela jhikahihitwe kuhumii kwa bhando machiko ghoha ghangapeta, nambo ngohe iyekulilwe kwa bhando bhake. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Chapanga akapahile kwatenda bhando bhake bhamanye ulohe na ukolongwa gwa chile jhenje nkate jha nnema ghoha, na jhene ndi jhenje, Kilichitu abhii nkate jhino na nhwalo gwenio ulangiya mangota natujhingila mung'alicho gwa Chapanga ghuuhobholeka. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Ndi mana tutangacha Kilichitu kwa bhando bhoha na kwa malango ghoha, tunkelebhuwa na kubhola mundo jhojhoha kupala tuhoto kunneta kila mundo palonge jha Chapanga kone abhii akomile mu kolombana na Kilichitu. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Kutangacha lilobhe lyenio, nenga ndenda kughagha kone nitumii likakala lya Kilichitu lilihenga lihengo nkate jhango.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Mbala umanyengane chinighagha kuhenga lihengo kwa nhwalo gwino mangota, kwa mabhando bha ku kilambo chu ku Laodikiya na bhando bhala bhangakongana na nenga. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Ndenda yenio nipala kwaleke mwojho na bhakilombe mulipalano kupala bhamanye kwa chakaka, nabhamanye njwe chile jha Chapanga, bhihoto kuimanya chile jhene ndi Kilichitu jwenio. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Nkate jhake ihihitwe ihukilo yoha ya malango nu kumanya.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Ninobholela mangannyekete jhe mundo jhojhoha ankolowe kwa malobhe ghuwange ata ghahalalila bhole. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Pamonga nenga kubhehe kutale na mangota, nambo mwojho ubhii peniya pamonga na mangota, na nihangana punimmona chimuhenga mahengo ghino kwa ndela jha mbone chimuhobholela Kilichitu kwa uchakaka.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ughome gwa chakaka ubhii kwa kulombana na Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Ngohe ngita chimunnyeketila Yecho Kilichitu kubhehe Bhambo, ndi nnyendelela hele kulombana nako. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Mme na ngegha nkate jhake, na ughome gwino uchengwike panane jhake na mukikamwii kihobholelo ngita chimolitwe, na mangota nchengule.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Mukilolekeye na mundo jhojhoha akotoka kunkolowa mangota kwa mabholo ghake gha jhajhe na ghuwange chika, ghighahobholela mapokelo gha bhando na michuka jhilongocha nnema, nambo ghahumajhe kwa Kilichitu jwenio! <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Nhwalo nkate jha Kilichitu, muyegha jhake utama ukamilicho ghoha gwa Chapanga, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />na mangota nkwete ughome telatela mu kulombana na jwenio. Jwenio abhii panane jha makakala ghoha gha kihuke na ukindendeke.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Kwa kulombana na Kilichitu mangota nnyingi jando kuhengwa jhe na bhando na kuileka yegha jha makacho jha uhakaho, nambo chi ngita chibhahenga bhando. Kukutendwa na Kilichitu jwenio kwa kukombolwa kuhumii muyegha jha uhakaho. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Nhwalo pubatichwa, mukachikitwe pamonga na Kilichitu, na muubaticho mangota helahela mukayokichwe pamonga na jwenio kuhumii mubaticho pala pumaghahobholila makakala gha Chapanga, ndi jwayokicha Yecho kuhumii muweghe <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Mangota mwe helahela makacho mukibha ngita nhwelingine kwa nhwalo gwa uhakaho gwino na nhwalo gwa umundo gwino gwanganandela ghubhii na uhakaho. Nambo ngohe Chapanga antei mangota mme maghome pamonga na Kilichitu. Chapanga atulekekiye uhakaho gwito ghoha, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />pajhomolila kuputa matakalilo ghito ghighajhandikwe na malaghilo gha kutuhadabuu twenga, ngakangila kutale, na ngakong'ondila pa nchalaba. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Panchalaba gwenio Kilichitu ndi pabhapokita makakala ghabhe bheniya ilongoche ya michuka na akanahota, ajhakwaleke hone palonge jha bhando kwatalaha ngita bhando bhibhapukilwe kungondo kwa langii kubhehe abhalepelii jhe.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Ngohe mangalogwa jhe mundo amekila nhwilo muchakulya amu muinywegho amu munyagho amu unyagho gwa kuhembukii mwehe amu mu Lichiko lya Kupomolela. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Ilebhe yenio ndi kiyeka tu cha ilebhe ipala kuhika, nambo uchakaka gwenie ubhii nkate jha Kilichitu. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Mangajhekete jhe kuhadabulwa na mundo jhojhoha jwakitenda jwamaha kwa nhwalo gwa uloto gwake na ndi aghaghalila unyenyekeho kwangachakaka kwa kwajhinamii akatumiche bha kunane kwa Chapanga, mundo ngita jwenio akiloka kwa nhwalo gwa ilebhe yaihwene na kwa nhwalo gwa malango ghake, <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />akilekite kukikamulii pamonga na Kilichitu, ndi jwabhii muto gwa yegha. Kupetele Kilichitu yegha jhoha ukamulana na kulombana pamonga kwa ihungo na micheketa jhake, na ukola ngita chapala Chapanga.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwegha na kutama pamonga na Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Mangota nhwile pamonga na Kilichitu na nkombolilwe kuhumii mu makakala gha ilongoche bhibhalongocha nnema. Nhwalo gwa nike ngohe mitama ngita bhando bha nnema ghongone? Kabhele nhwalo gwa nike mukamuu malaghilo ngita ghenagha, <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Mangakamu jhe chenje amu nkotoka kupaha chenje amu nkotoka kupapaya chela!” <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Ilebhe yenio yoha ukomelekeya pitumika, gheniya malaghilo na mabholo gha bhando tu. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Chakaka malaghilo gheniya ghibhonekana ghina malango mu kunyinamila ghabhatungite bhene, na unyenyekeho kwangabhehe na uchakaka mukuilongocha yegha kwa ukale, nambo ghakwetejhe makakala gha kuhibhilikiya tama jha yegha.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Ngohe anda uyokichwe pamonga na Kilichitu, uwachila mambu gha kunane kwa Chapanga, kwabhii Kilichitu, kwenio itama chehemo jha ulongoche jha lubhoko lwalelo lwa Chapanga. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Uwachila mambu gha kunane kwa Chapanga, yenio chi mambu gha pannema pano. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Nhwalo mangota uwilingine, na ughome gwino uhiitwe pamonga na Kilichitu nkate jha Chapanga. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Ughome gwino gwa chakaka ndi Kilichitu, na papala kupitila kabhele na mangota nampitila pamonga na jwenie mung'alicho!<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ughome gwa makacho na ughome nhyono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Bhahe, nkome kila kilebhe changanandela chikibhii nkate jhino, ngongola na kuhenga ghanganandela na tama ya kubhehe na ilebhe ndii na mawacho ghanganandela na kijhaka chikilandana na kuijhinamii inyagho. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Kwa nhwalo gwa gheniya ghoha Chapanga nabhabhekela lilaka bhando bhoha bhangampala kunnyokanikiya. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Makacho mangota ntamita hele, punongwichwa na gheniya ghanganandela.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Nambo ngoheno mughaleke gheniya ghoha, lilaka na njoghololo na maligho na manganigha jhe Chapanga na mangalonge jhe malobhe ghanganandela pannomo gwino. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Mangakoloyana jhe, nhwalo mangota mulekite umundo gwa makacho pamonga na matendwa ghake ghoha ghanganandela, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />na muhwalite umundo nhyono. Ghutendwa nhyono mumanye Chapanga kwa uchakaka, na kulandana na jwenio jwapangana umundo nhyono. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Peniya palekine jhe pakate jha mundo jwa kilambo chenge na Uyahude, jwajhingii jando na jwangajhingii jando, akaghene amu jwangachoma na mmanda amu jwangabhehe mmanda. Nambo Kilichitu ndi ghoha, na jwenio abhii mughoha.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Kwa nhwalo mangota ndi bhando bha Chapanga, jwenio akampahile na ahagwile mme bhando bhake, ngohe nkola kiya na umbone na unyenyekeho na utokomalo na luhimba. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Nhimbililane na kulekekehana anda mundo pakate jhino ankokolekeya nnyake. Mupalwa kulekekehana malemo ngita Bhambo chanenekekeya mangota. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Kuchocha kwa gheniya, nnyonjekeye kupalana, nhwalo upalo ulombikana ghoha nde kwa uchakaka. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Na uteeke gwa Kilichitu ulongoche umwojho gwino, nhwalo Chapanga ankemite mangota mme yegha jhimo. Kabhele mma na luchengulo! <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Lilobhe lya Kilichitu litwelela twe mwenio nkate jhino. Mmolane na kukelebhuhana kwa malango ghoha. Kone nnyemba Zabule na mihambo jha kunnomba Chapanga na nnyembengane mihambo jha kunchenguu Chapanga kumiojho jhino. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Kila chimuhenga amu kukilongela, ntendengane yoha kwa liina lya Bhambo gwito Yecho Kilichitu kone muchengula Chapanga Tate kupete jwenio.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabholo kwa nyumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Na mangota akakeghe, majhokanikiya akangana bhino, yenio ndi chapala Bhambo.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Na mangota akanalome, mapale akahana bhino na nkotoka kwalakalila bheniya.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Na mangota akayana mwajhokanikiya akatate bhino machiko ghoha, yenio ndi chinhalalila Bhambo.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Na mangota akatate, nkotoka kwachimwa yana hino, anda nahajhe nabhahengeleka mwojho.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Na mangota akabhanda majhokanikiya akanahota bhino mughoha. Chi pibhannolokeya tugha kupala mmonekane bhambone, nambo ntenda gheniya kwa mwojho gwambone nhwalo gwa kunnyeketela Bhambo Yecho. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Chochoha chimuhenga, nhenge kwa mwojho ghoha, anda muntende Bhambo Yecho na chi nhwalo gwa mundo. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Nkomboka kubhehe Bhambo nampelengana ndweko yabhekite kwa bhando bhake. Chakaka Kilichitu ndi Bhambo jhumutumikila! <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Nhwalo kila mundo jwatenda ghanganandela, napokela malepo ghanganandela ghake, nhwalo Chapanga abaghuu jhe bhando.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Na mangota akanahota, mwatendelengana akabhanda bhino ghambone na ngita chapala Chapanga, kone nkombokela na mangota helahela nkwete Bhambo kunane kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Munnyope Chapanga changatotokela, na pumunyopa Chapanga mukilolekeya na kunchenguu Chapanga. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Helahela mutujhopela na twenga kupala Chapanga atujhoghojolele nnyango gwa kutangacha Lilobhe tutangache chile jha Kilichitu. Kwa nhwalo gwa Lilobhe lya Mbone nenga ngohe mmi mu kipungo. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Ngohe unyopele nhoto kulongele ngita chiipala chile kulongelwa meke mbegha chile jhene.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Mme na malango palonge jha bhando bhangannyeketele Kilichitu, nkachane kutumii mbone kila pwache jhiminajho. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Machiko ghoha nnongela ghaumbone na gha kwajhangatii bhando, na umanye kwajhanguu mbone bhando machiko ghoha.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyambucho jha kujhomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Tikiko nnongo gwito jhutumpahile, na ntumiche jwahobholeka na ntumiche nnyito mulihengo lya Bhambo, nanobholela mihalo jhango jhoha. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Ndi nhwalo nintuma kwino ankangamalicha mwojho gwino kwa kunnobholela malobhe ghito. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Ahika kwenio pamonga na Onechimo, nnongo gwito jhutumpala na jwahobholeka jweniojho ndi nnyino. Jwenio ndi nnyino nanongolela mihalo jha ilebhe itendika pambano.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Alisitako, jwatabhitwe pamonga na nenga, inyambucha pamonga na Maluku nnongo mundo Banaba helahela inyambucha. Mukajhohine njwe malaghilo ghake. Papala kuhika kwino mupokele. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Na jwenio Yochuwa helahela jwakemitwa Yusito, jhunyohina mihalo jhake inyambucha. Pakate jha Akayahude bhibhapokii kihobholelo njwe, bhamba tu kanjika bhibhahenga lihengo pamonga na nenga kwa nhwalo gwa Unahota nkolongwa gwa Chapanga, bhene ndi bhingangamalicha hake nenga.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafula, mundo jwa kilambo chino, ntumiche jwa Yecho Kilichitu inyambucha. Machiko ghoha jwenio ighagha kunyopela kwa Chapanga nnyemangane nganganga, nkomale na nnyendelela kuhobholela na kuhenga ghighanhalalicha Chapanga. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Nihoto kulonge ahenga lihengo kwa nhwalo gwino mangota na kwa nhwalo gwa bhando bha ku Laodikiya na bhala bhubhabhii ku Hilapole. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Luka, jhola nng'anga gwito jhutumpala na Dema bhinyambucha.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Mwajhambuche akalongo bhito bhubhabhii ku Laodikiya na nnombo gwito Nifa pamonga na lilongo lyoha lya bhando lilinyeketii Kilichitu lilikongana kajhake. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Anda nnyomolela kuchoma baluwa jhenje, mwapela bhajhino bhibhanyeketii Kilichitu bhu ku Laodikeya na bhene bhaichome, na baluwa jhinajhandikile bhando bhu ku Laodikiya na mangota bhampele nchome. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Na munobholele Alukipo, “Nyomole lihengo lyapokii kuhumii kwa Bhambo.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Ne Pauli nyandike ghanga kwa lubhoko lwango namwete, ninyambucha. Nkomboka nenga mmii mukipungo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Naninyopela umbone kubhoke kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>